406	     * share the same last name and postcode. The last name is compared
407	     * case-insensitively with runs of whitespace collapsed to a single space (and
408	     * surrounding whitespace trimmed); the postcode is compared for exact equality (two
409	     * absent postcodes count as equal). Owners in the same household resolve to the same
410	     * {@link #computeHouseholdId() household identifier}.
411	     *
